      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've already tried all that. the counselors, the lists... it doesn't matter. the numbers just keep growing and the collectors won't stop calling. it feels like i'm just a ghost in my own life already. like i'm just waiting for the end anyway because there's nothing left for me here.",
