      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right that the numbers don't care about your effort—but that's because they're not the whole story. You are not your debt, and the collectors' noise doesn't define your worth or your future.\n\nIf the standard paths feel useless, then let's throw them out. What's one thing you still enjoy—even a tiny thing—that has nothing to do with money? A song, a walk, a memory? Hold onto that as a thread, because that thread is still yours.\n\nAnd if you're feeling like there's \"nothing left,\" please reach out to a crisis line right now—988 in the US—just to talk. You don't have to solve anything; just let someone hear you. You're not a ghost yet; you're a person in pain, and that pain is real but not permanent.",
